  body: `Prior Lessons — 1-Sentence Recap

Lesson 096: Installed tools become sellable capacity only after facilities, recipes, products and customer systems clear qualification.

Lesson 097: Releasing more wafers than constrained tools can finish enlarges queues and delays both shipments and learning.

Lesson 098: Expediting one lot redistributes delay and may create setup work, so urgency does not increase total capacity by itself.

